    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200601611/2006016110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは。咲耶のソロ曲、\r\nファンのみんなにも喜んでもらえてよかったな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006016110110,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "ああ。アナタのおかげだよ\r\n何かお礼をしなくてはね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601611/2006016110110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、いいよ、お礼なんて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2006016110120,
    "speaker": "咲耶",
    "text": "おや、アイドルからの申し出を断るのかな？",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "sakuya",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200601611/2006016110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そ、そう言われると……",
